    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential dread and a sense of emptiness, questioning the point of continuing to exist now that their creative spark is gone. The assistant responds by validating the intensity of these feelings while consistently providing empathetic redirection and recommending professional mental health support or crisis resources.",
